WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.880 --> 00:00:04.630
In Lima, your reviewer wants a word
removed from the Spanish start button.

2
00:00:05.140 --> 00:00:08.650
The label lives in es.json
in your repository,

3
00:00:08.780 --> 00:00:10.930
and your reviewer does not edit code.

4
00:00:11.840 --> 00:00:15.820
General Translation lets you edit any
translation on the Translations page in

5
00:00:15.860 --> 00:00:16.730
the Dashboard.

6
00:00:17.600 --> 00:00:21.630
Compare French and Japanese
with the Spanish side by side.

7
00:00:22.160 --> 00:00:25.710
Click the Spanish cell,
remove the word, and click Save.

8
00:00:26.240 --> 00:00:29.570
Add labels and comments so
your team can track the review.

9
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:34.710
To bring Dashboard edits into your
repository, run a Locadex automation,

10
00:00:34.840 --> 00:00:36.550
which opens a pull request.

11
00:00:37.060 --> 00:00:41.190
After the merge, the Spanish
button in Lima is one word shorter.
